# Settings for compose.yaml at 262K context (one pair on 4x B200):
#   docker compose -f compose.yaml --env-file dsv41-262k.env up --no-deps pd
# For the Oracle coding replay (prompts to ~203K tokens; loadtest/README.md).
# Values run to the end of the line; no shell expansion.

DSV41_IMAGE=dsv41-pd:latest
DSV41_MODEL=/data/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
DSV41_DATA=/data/dsv41-bringup

GPUS=4,5,6,7
PORT=8040
BOOTSTRAP_PORT=8999
NCCL_PORT=29600
ROUTER_METRICS_PORT=29001

# dsv41.env's flags (HiCache included) with three changes, verified 2026-11-09 (B200 non-CED,
# Oracle coding and realmix sweeps to 256 sessions, no worker errors):
# --context-length 262144.
# --max-total-tokens 1048576 (prefill pool, was 1.5M): the 1.5M pool left ~1.3 GiB
#   free per prefill rank after graph capture, and a ~200K-token prompt OOMed in
#   the first eager chunk past the 65536 graph cap. 1M frees ~4.4 GiB per rank,
#   but it still OOMed under 16 concurrent ~100K-token sessions: 5.5 GiB was
#   reserved but fragmented when MoE asked for 1.64 GiB in a 12K eager chunk.
#   Mooncake rejects PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments.
# --chunk-size 8192 (was 12288): prefill graphs ~2.9 GB smaller (14.6 GB free
#   after capture vs 10.7 GB) and a third less transient memory per eager chunk.
# A prefill that dies leaves the container up and the router answering 503 until
# the pair is restarted.
# HiCache on prefill with the ratio auto-sized from host RAM, as in dsv41.env
# (capped at 8: ~8M host tokens on this 1M pool). Past ~32 concurrent
# conversations the 1M prefix cache thrashes (loadtest/README.md), and the host
# tier reloads that KV instead of re-prefilling it. The 2026-11-09 results were
# measured with HiCache off: on the 4x B200 test VM the Engram cache locks
# ~198 GiB of 250 GiB, leaving ~9 GiB, and auto turns it off there.
DSV41_LAUNCH_ARGS=--gpu-models B200 --context-length 262144 --chunk-size 8192 --prefill-requests 16 --prefill-schedule-policy hrrn --decode-requests 128 --decode-graph-extra-bs 10,12,14 --decode-polling-interval 2 --tokenizer-workers 4 --prefill-swa-prefix-tails 256 --max-total-tokens 1048576 --prefill-hicache-ratio auto --decode-max-total-tokens 4194304 --mem-fraction 0.92 --custom-all-reduce on --prefill-env SGLANG_OPT_DSV41_ENGRAM_STAGING_PREFETCH=1 --prefill-env SGLANG_DSV41_ENGRAM_GATHER_THREADS=8 --prefill-env NCCL_PROTO=LL128 --prefill-env SGLANG_ENABLE_DISAGG_PREFILL_EARLY_RESULT=1 --prefill-env SGLANG_HRRN_SIZE_EXPONENT=1.5 --prefill-env SGLANG_OPT_PREFIX_PROMPT_ENCODE=1 --decode-env SGLANG_OPT_DSV41_ENGRAM_STAGING_PREFETCH=1 --decode-env SGLANG_DSV41_ENGRAM_GATHER_THREADS=8 --decode-env SGLANG_OPT_PREFIX_PROMPT_ENCODE=1 --prefill-graph-max-seq-len 65536 --compact-host-memory --kernel-cache-dir /data/dsv41-bringup/container-cache/dsv41-pd-latest --decode-radix-cache --router-max-concurrent-requests 192 --router-queue-size 256 --router-queue-timeout-secs 30
DSV41_EXTRA_ARGS=
